<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-034-A habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.168752" lon="-120.849429"><name>SC26-034-A</name><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 14.0 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 82/100; not catch probability. Center 154 ft; nearby 141–189 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-015</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 125-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.16789889784989" lon="-120.84961640784383"/><trkpt lat="35.16790474379595" lon="-120.8499456106978"/><trkpt lat="35.168355284992636" lon="-120.84993374609918"/><trkpt lat="35.16836892228409" lon="-120.85070189069123"/><trkpt lat="35.16899562768055" lon="-120.85076855202705"/><trkpt lat="35.16939801975191" lon="-120.85055304634993"/><trkpt lat="35.1697020610044" lon="-120.85016641088617"/><trkpt lat="35.16986146264539" lon="-120.8496675076532"/><trkpt lat="35.16985195644193" lon="-120.84913229255478"/><trkpt lat="35.169599258520066" lon="-120.84891289487348"/><trkpt lat="35.16959730895393" lon="-120.84880315837627"/><trkpt lat="35.16950720080304" lon="-120.84880553267342"/><trkpt lat="35.16950525114406" lon="-120.84869579630765"/><trkpt lat="35.16941514299815" lon="-120.84869817071514"/><trkpt lat="35.16941319324634" lon="-120.84858843448079"/><trkpt lat="35.169323085105425" lon="-120.84859080899862"/><trkpt lat="35.169321135260766" lon="-120.84848107289571"/><trkpt lat="35.169231027124845" lon="-120.84848344752392"/><trkpt lat="35.16922907718735" lon="-120.84837371155241"/><trkpt lat="35.169048860924" lon="-120.84837846101895"/><trkpt lat="35.16904399286328" lon="-120.84810452603512"/><trkpt lat="35.168508357770854" lon="-120.84808945672192"/><trkpt lat="35.16801861280542" lon="-120.8483874987229"/><trkpt lat="35.16774715993522" lon="-120.84880856193556"/><trkpt lat="35.16763770327414" lon="-120.8496232871005"/><trkpt lat="35.16789889784989" lon="-120.84961640784383"/></trkseg></trk><trk><name>SC-DRIFT-034</name><desc>Principal axis of raised mapped rough habitat within 180 m of target. Optional structure alignment; actual drift depends on measured wind/current. Not a navigation route.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.167700790313624" lon="-120.8476457205042"/><trkpt lat="35.169803184888394" lon="-120.85121232611728"/></trkseg></trk></gpx>
